  "job_A10.6_20260920_210245": {
    "chunk_text": "Her Eadward kingc, Engla hlaford, sende so\u00fef\u00e6ste sawle to Criste on godes w\u00e6ra, gast haligne. He on worulda her wunode \u00ferage on kyne\u00ferymme, cr\u00e6ftig r\u00e6da, XXIIII, freolic wealdend, wintra W\u00e6s a bli\u00f0emod bealuleas kyng, \u00feeah he lange \u00e6r, lande bereafod, wunode wr\u00e6clastum wide geond Sy\u00f0\u00f0an for\u00f0 becom freolice in geatwum kyningc kystum god, cl\u00e6ne and milde, Eadward se \u00e6\u00f0ela, e\u00f0el And se froda swa \u00feeah bef\u00e6ste \u00fe\u00e6t rice heah\u00feungenum menn, Harolde sylfum, \u00e6\u00feelum eorle, se in.",
